  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】雪道運転不要！秋の紅葉＆冬の無料送迎バス付き絶景温泉宿比較！定山渓・花巻・上諏訪</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-sky-950 flex items-center gap-2\">❄️ 雪道運転の不安ゼロ！駅前シャトルで直行する幻想的な雪見・紅葉露天風呂</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">冬の温泉旅行で最大のハードルとなる「雪道運転・チェーン装着」。新幹線駅や主要ターミナルから専用無料送迎バスを運行する宿なら、温かい車内で景色を眺めているだけで白銀の雪見露天風呂へ直行できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 無料送迎付きの厳選雪見・紅葉名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.12</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/20619/20619.jpg\" alt=\"定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【JR札幌駅より無料送迎バス直行】定山渓温泉の渓谷美と5つの温泉大浴場＆ビュッフェ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">札幌駅前から毎日専用無料送迎バスが運行。雪見露天風呂や焼きたてピザ・ステーキバイキングで北海道の冬旅を満喫。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、カップル、車なしで北海道温泉を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>札幌駅直通無料シャトルと定山渓の雪見温泉なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D20619\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.27</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/9546/9546.jpg\" alt=\"花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【JR新花巻駅・花巻駅より無料送迎】17の浴槽湯巡り＆渓流雪見露天風呂と前沢牛</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">新幹線停車駅の新花巻駅から無料送迎。3つの自家源泉と渓流露天風呂、岩手の銘酒利き酒と前沢牛会席が絶品。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、シニア、新幹線で東北の秘湯に行きたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>新幹線駅直通送迎と17の浴槽湯巡りならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D9546\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/52948/52948.jpg\" alt=\"信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【JR上諏訪駅より無料送迎】諏訪湖一望の二色の自家源泉＆諏訪五蔵地酒セット</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">特急あずさ停車の上諏訪駅から送迎すぐ。諏訪湖を望む展望露天風呂や諏訪五蔵の銘酒飲み比べが好評。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>カップル、ご夫婦、電車で信州の美景を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>諏訪湖パノラマ展望温泉と駅近送迎ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D52948\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
